Meeting notifications about a lead open the lead.

Base: zan-workspace main at 1d42333. Independent of push-channel-levels.patch: apply either, both,
in any order.
    git apply --check meeting-lead-url.patch
    git apply meeting-lead-url.patch

parentUrlFromMeeting returned undefined when meeting.entityType was 0, because it tested
`!meeting?.entityType` and ENTITY_TYPE.LEAD is 0. So a meeting on a lead had no url: the bell row was
not a link, a browser push opened the inbox, and a phone push had no record to open. Client (1) and
project (2) meetings were fine. Old rows keep their missing url; new ones get it.

